@itsm.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt

GET {{itsm.WebApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get the current tenant's active-user quota (admin token required)
GET {{itsm.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/me/user-quota
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

